# Binary files must never have their line endings changed. A converted PNG fails to load,
# and the build rejects it. (Deliberately no "* text=auto": this repository mixes line endings.)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.map binary
*.bin binary
*.dds binary
*.tga binary
